# Call sites that still pass their own literal default (#439, epic #437).
#
# EMPTY since #440: every call site reads its default from the table in
# scripts/pipeline-defaults.sh. tests/test-callsite-literal-defaults.sh fails on
# any literal-default call, and fails if this list has an entry.
#
# One line per occurrence would be: <path relative to the repo root> TAB <the call>.
#
# Do not add a line to silence the test: a new call should read its default
# from the table (call it with no default argument) or, when the default is
# computed, pass a computed (non-literal) one.
